silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_01_dependency_as_typed_arrow_concrete_anchor_5 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_dependency_as_typed_arrow #5', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Dependency as Typed Arrow' the bare symbol RuntimeAtom anchors to MittensTraceFingerprint: The trace leg: an observable artifact that fires when the published claim is consumed downstream — a log line saying 'Mittens measurement-leg fetched 2024-04-12 by VetCarePlan_77.'." .
